<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Nissan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Nissan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 50.36		vs	   50.59</p>
<p> Operating   loss 544    million    vs     loss 1.62</p>
<p> Current	 loss 1.23		vs     loss 2.52</p>
<p> Net	   loss 797    million    vs     loss 2.74</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 18.14 yen	  vs    loss 62.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     44 million	  vs	  44 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Nissan Auto Sales Co Ltd is a car dealer affiliated with Nissan Motor Co Ltd.</p>
